{
  "declaredLength": 3904,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "開門見山，就聽我說！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B9580898B5C71FF0C5C31807D62118AAAFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們發現了一個被鎖球的\n精靈球。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011767C73FE4E864E00500B88AB939674037684000A7CBE97487403300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鎖球？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93967403FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是什麼？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F4EC09EBCFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是閃焰隊的研究之一啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n以前閃焰隊試著要讓精靈球\n感染電腦病毒，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n想靠這招讓球沒辦法用。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F95837130968A768478147A764E4B4E005566300200100001BE01000A4EE5524D95837130968A8A66845789818B937CBE97487403000A611F67D396FB816675C56BD2FF0C00100001BE00000A60F39760901962DB8B9374036C928FA66CD57528300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很誇張的研究吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是真的有了成果的話，\n卡洛斯地區今天就不知道會是什麼樣子了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F888A875F35768478147A765427FF1F00100001BE01000A8981662F771F768467094E866210679C76848A71FF0C000A53616D1B65AF573053404ECA59295C314E0D77E590536703662F4EC09EBC6A235B504E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n開門見山，進入正題！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A958B9580898B5C71FF0C903251656B63984CFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個被鎖的球裡面\n有隻叫做<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>波爾凱尼恩<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B88AB93967684740388E19762000A670996BB53EB505A00100002FF0000066CE2723E51F15C3C606900100002FF00000076845BF653EF5922300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "至於為什麼被稱為幻之寶可夢的\n波爾凱尼恩會在球裡，那就是個謎了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81F365BC70BA4EC09EBC88AB7A3170BA5E7B4E4B5BF653EF59227684000A6CE2723E51F15C3C606967035728740388E1FF0C90A35C31662F500B8B0E4E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之呢，我就是想讓這隻\n被關在裡面的寶可夢可以出來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D4E4B5462FF0C62115C31662F60F38B93901996BB000A88AB95DC572888E1976276845BF653EF592253EF4EE551FA4F86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這就是為什麼需要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為讓波爾凱尼恩從球裡出來後，\n我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以捉住牠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C31662F70BA4EC09EBC9700898100100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100001BE01000A56E070BA8B936CE2723E51F15C3C60695F9E740388E151FA4F865F8CFF0C000A62115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE563494F4F7260300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要捉波爾凱尼恩了，\n就告訴我一聲吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D898163496CE2723E51F15C3C60694E86FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E0080725427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳做好要捉住波爾凱尼恩的\n覺悟……準備了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3505A597D898163494F4F6CE2723E51F15C3C60697684000A89BA609F202620266E9650994E8655CEFF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波爾凱尼恩在等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE2723E51F15C3C606957287B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B35594FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好很～好！\n那我們這就來開始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597D5F88FF5E597DFF01000A90A36211501190195C314F86958B59CB5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，其實有個問題。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了放波爾凱尼恩出來，\n我做了一個可以清除電腦病毒，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且可以不破壞球的結構\n就把球打開來的裝置，但是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有不祥的預感",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167094E0D796576849810611F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波爾凱尼恩的力量是\n超級無敵無窮大。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我推測牠離開球的瞬間就會大鬧，\n而且這個機率是100％！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE2723E51F15C3C60697684529B91CF662F000A8D857D1A7121657571217AAE5927300200100001BE01000A621163A86E2C726096E2958B7403768477AC95935C31670359279B27FF0C000A800C4E149019500B6A5F7387662F003100300030FF05FF01FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳放心！\n我找了一個波爾凱尼恩的專家來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E00100003110000FF01014F6059B3653E5FC3FF01000A6211627E4E864E00500B6CE2723E51F15C3C606976845C085BB64F86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "專家？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C085BB6FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有這樣的人？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670990196A2376844EBAFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F6211FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "跑遍了密阿雷每條街道的我，\n用最短距離從密阿雷出版社跑來了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DD1904D4E865BC6963F96F76BCF689D8857905376846211FF0C000A7528670077ED8DDD96E25F9E5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E8DD14F864E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伊馮是密阿雷出版社的副總編輯。\n她手裡握有波爾凱尼恩的機密筆記喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F0A99AE662F5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E7684526F7E3D7DE88F2F3002000A5979624B88E163E167096CE2723E51F15C3C606976846A5F5BC67B468A185594300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根據機密筆記上記載的\n波爾凱尼恩的力量的秘密……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「若要引發威力足以\n轟飛整座山的水蒸氣的爆炸，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n合理推測牠的體內必須具有\n超高溫的器官，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n該器官的溫度之高，\n甚至能將水分瞬間汽化」。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "此外，在建國秘辛則記載著……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「在卡洛斯地區西南部的\n民間習俗中，似乎將波爾凱尼恩<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n視為建國的寶可夢，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n人們因此崇敬牠。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n當地居民認為\n自己所居住的平原，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就是在波爾凱尼恩引發的\n水蒸氣的爆炸後形成的」。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根本就是猛到天搖地動嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6839672C5C31662F731B523059296416573052D5561BFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟卡洛斯的南部過去曾經發生過\n原因不明的大爆炸，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n造成巨大的山脈就此消失。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF53616D1B65AF7684535790E8904E53BB66FE7D93767C751F904E000A539F56E04E0D660E76845927720670B8FF0C00100001BE00000A902062105DE8592776845C7181085C316B646D885931300200100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼想都是\n波爾凱尼恩的傑作吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC60F390FD662F000A6CE2723E51F15C3C6069768450914F5C5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然理性上會猶豫要不要放牠出來，\n但心情上我還是想讓牠出來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136740660274E0A670373368C6B89814E0D8981653E726051FA4F86FF0C000A4F465FC360C54E0A62119084662F60F38B93726051FA4F86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n我們到研究所的地下室去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A62115011523078147A766240768457304E0B5BA453BB5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽得到吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D5F9752305427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和伊馮會在房間外面\n為<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的奮鬥加油打氣的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C4F0A99AE67035728623F959359169762000A70BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684596E9B2552A06CB962536C237684FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟待在同一個房間裡\n太危險了嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF5F855728540C4E00500B623F959388E1000A592A537196AA4E86561B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，把我剛才交給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的那個\n關住波爾凱尼恩的球投出去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C628A6211525B624D4EA47D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3768490A3500B000A95DC4F4F6CE2723E51F15C3C606976847403629551FA53BB5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波爾凱尼恩……看樣子果然會大鬧一番呢。\n那就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳加油捉住牠囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE2723E51F15C3C606920262026770B6A235B50679C7136670359279B274E00756A54623002000A90A35C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B352A06CB963494F4F726056C9FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波哦～噢！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE254E6FF5E5662FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳捉住牠啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F898100100003110000FF01014F6059B363494F4F7260554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叮叮噹噹！\n勇者漂亮地捉住了波爾凱尼恩！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EE53EE56795679FF01000A52C780056F024EAE573063494F4F4E866CE2723E51F15C3C6069FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不論是什麼樣的寶可夢，\n只要被捉住後就會變溫順，真是好神奇。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8AD6662F4EC09EBC6A2376845BF653EF5922FF0C000A53EA898188AB63494F4F5F8C5C3167038B8A6EAB9806FF0C771F662F597D795E5947300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "見到了幻之寶可夢戰鬥的樣子，\n我的身心到現在都還在顫抖著。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898B52304E865E7B4E4B5BF653EF592262309B2576846A235B50FF0C000A621176848EAB5FC3523073FE572890FD90845728986B62968457300200100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有個請求。\n要是能請波爾凱尼恩把密阿雷的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有的沒的都轟了，那麼跑起馬拉松就……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116709500B8ACB6C423002000A8981662F80FD8ACB6CE2723E51F15C3C6069628A5BC6963F96F7768400100001BE00000A670976846C92768490FD8F5F4E86FF0C90A39EBC8DD18D7799AC62C9677E5C312026202600100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳給我差不多一點啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B37D6662115DEE4E0D591A4E009EDE5566FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我當然是開玩笑的。\n但我好像能寫篇不輸給編輯長的報導了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621175767136662F958B73A97B1176843002000A4F466211597D50CF80FD5BEB7BC74E0D8F387D667DE88F2F9577768458315C0E4E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我要跑回密阿雷出版社了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C621189818DD156DE5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E4E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一定還有不少人或寶可夢，\n是因為閃焰隊捅的婁子而失去自由的吧……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n畢竟我也是隻叫做代理所長的籠中鳥。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E005B9A908467094E0D5C114EBA62165BF653EF5922FF0C000A662F56E070BA95837130968A634576845A415B50800C593153BB81EA7531768454272026202600100001BE00000A75627ADF62114E5F662F96BB53EB505A4EE374066240957776847C604E2D9CE5300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但獲得了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這個新搭檔的\n波爾凱尼恩就不一樣了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4673725F974E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B39019500B65B0642D6A947684000A6CE2723E51F15C3C60695C314E0D4E006A234E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今後牠可以和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n一起去做有趣的事，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且那就是訓練家的本分嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA5F8C726053EF4EE5548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A4E008D7753BB505A67098DA376844E8BFF0C00100001BE00000A800C4E1490A35C31662F8A137DF45BB67684672C5206561B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也多虧了你們，\n才有機會見到有趣的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F591A86674E864F605011FF0C000A624D67096A5F6703898B523067098DA376844E8B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜拜～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62DCFF5EFF0100100002011400070000",
